# Optimised-vs-baseline layout sweep, one variant per run of baseline.sh (jobs/m3_opt.sbatch
# loops over the variants with CLOVER_BIN/VARIANT/OUT_DIR). KERNELS RANKS THREADS DECK THP.
# C kernels only: 64x2 is the baseline layout, the other four are the comparison points of
# matrix.m3; THP off only at 1x128, the only layout where it mattered in the baseline.
c       64  2   clover_bm16_short.in on
c       1   128 clover_bm16_short.in on
c       1   128 clover_bm16_short.in off
c       4   32  clover_bm16_short.in on
c       32  4   clover_bm16_short.in on
c       128 1   clover_bm16_short.in on
